{"schema_version":"genshin-world-lore-card-v1","lore_id":"species_elemental_lifeforms","name_zh":"元素生命","name_en":"Elemental Lifeforms","aliases":["元素生命","元素生物","Elemental Lifeforms"],"category":"species","scope":"global","regions":[],"summary":"元素生命是以元素能量本身作为生命构成核心的生命类别，不应与仅能借用自然元素力的普通生命混同。现有文本还记录了不符合既有元素生物特征、能够借助其他生物外形活动的特殊个体。","canonical_facts":[{"fact_id":"elemental_lifeforms_fact_01","text":"元素生命由纯粹的元素能量构成。","status":"confirmed","temporal_scope":"一般定义","visibility":"specialist_knowledge","source_ids":["fandom_species_elemental_lifeforms","fandom_sup_species_elemental_lifeforms_01"]},{"fact_id":"elemental_lifeforms_fact_02","text":"主要来源的正文将元素生命进一步描述为仅由一种元素构成，但同页类型表中存在多元素条目，因此“所有元素生命都只由一种元素构成”这一绝对限定存在内部不一致。","status":"disputed","temporal_scope":"当前来源版本中的分类定义","visibility":"not_applicable","source_ids":["fandom_species_elemental_lifeforms","fandom_sup_species_elemental_lifeforms_01"]},{"fact_id":"elemental_lifeforms_fact_03","text":"纳西妲以普通生命为例说明：生命体即使能够使用元素力，也可能只是在借用自然中的元素力，并不因此成为元素生物。","status":"reported","temporal_scope":"「若忘记家在何处」期间","visibility":"specialist_knowledge","source_ids":["local_sup_species_elemental_lifeforms_01"]},{"fact_id":"elemental_lifeforms_fact_04","text":"纳西妲检查过一个具有蕈类外壳的特殊元素生物；该个体在外壳之下没有与蕈类相似的生态结构，取而代之的是元素的奔流。","status":"reported","temporal_scope":"「若忘记家在何处」期间","visibility":"secret_or_exceptional","source_ids":["local_sup_species_elemental_lifeforms_01"]},{"fact_id":"elemental_lifeforms_fact_05","text":"针对该特殊个体，纳西妲称元素视野能够帮助观察者辨别它与普通生物的差异。","status":"reported","temporal_scope":"「若忘记家在何处」期间","visibility":"restricted_knowledge","source_ids":["local_sup_species_elemental_lifeforms_02"]},{"fact_id":"elemental_lifeforms_fact_06","text":"纳西妲声称自己掌握提瓦特生物及元素生物特征方面的系统知识，但已知元素生物的全部特征仍无法与该特殊个体对应。","status":"reported","temporal_scope":"「若忘记家在何处」期间","visibility":"secret_or_exceptional","source_ids":["local_sup_species_elemental_lifeforms_03"]},{"fact_id":"elemental_lifeforms_fact_07","text":"该特殊个体自称其族群属于草元素生物，是大陆上最古老的生命之一，具有较强适应力；它还称改变形态需要力量与时间。此说法仅代表该个体对自身族群的陈述，不能推广至全部元素生命。","status":"reported","temporal_scope":"该特殊个体对其古老族群的自述","visibility":"secret_or_exceptional","source_ids":["local_sup_species_elemental_lifeforms_03","local_sup_species_elemental_lifeforms_04"]}],"timeline":[{"period":"「若忘记家在何处」事件期间","order_hint":1,"events":["纳西妲检查一个外形类似蕈兽的个体，将其认定为元素生物，随后又发现已知元素生物的全部特征均无法与该个体对应。"],"current_status":"该个体仍被称为元素生命或元素生物，但其具体性质与族群历史在现有证据中主要来自其自述。","source_ids":["local_sup_species_elemental_lifeforms_01","local_sup_species_elemental_lifeforms_03"]}],"relationships":[],"in_world_visibility":{"public_summary":"“元素生物”这一分类及其判别特征至少为纳西妲所知；一名特殊元素生命也将相关适应和变形知识称为其族群的常识。现有证据不足以证明普通社会普遍了解这一分类。","likely_known_by":["纳西妲","该特殊元素生命及其同族（仅就其自述的族群常识而言）","亲历「若忘记家在何处」相关事件后的派蒙与旅行者"],"unlikely_known_by":["事件发生前的派蒙（至少不熟悉该特殊个体为何属于元素生物）"],"common_beliefs_or_misconceptions":["潜在混淆：能够使用元素力并不等同于由元素构成；普通生命可能只是在借用自然中的元素力。"]},"activation_keys":["元素生命","元素生物","Elemental Lifeforms"],"excluded_material":{"gameplay_only":["将元素生命划分为普通敌人、精英敌人、普通首领或特殊敌人的玩法表格分类","对自身元素免疫、自身元素附着及触发元素反应的战斗机制描述","掉落物、等级门槛、图鉴与画廊资产以及版本新增记录"],"unsupported_or_speculative":["将该特殊个体关于古老程度、适应力和变形机制的自述推广至全部元素生命","断言元素生命的分类知识已在提瓦特普通社会中普及","在同页分类表存在多元素条目的情况下，断言所有元素生命必然只由一种元素构成"]},"sources":[{"source_id":"fandom_species_elemental_lifeforms","provider":"fandom","role":"primary","title":"Elemental Lifeforms","url":"https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/wiki/Elemental_Lifeforms","language":"en","revision_id":"2105756","source_text_sha256":"40cead832faa204e78703fbcad59b92ff12936ab9f97114e5f01da9c4bfe3f86"},{"source_id":"fandom_sup_species_elemental_lifeforms_01","provider":"fandom","role":"primary","title":"Elemental Lifeforms","url":"https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/wiki/Elemental_Lifeforms","language":"en","revision_id":"2105756","source_text_sha256":"9de61091a12115b05a3e6274dd7e041952b423675a43b89dfc23a88deb7ea43f"},{"source_id":"local_sup_species_elemental_lifeforms_01","provider":"local_dialogue","role":"local_dialogue_verification","title":"若忘记家在何处","url":"local://YuanShenResources/CHS/Quest/Quest_13019.json#unit=1301902","language":"zh-CN","revision_id":"OSCBWin6.7.54","source_text_sha256":"5d69ee1631aff7828a231b68d6e3791c2c87831d3efc033a779ca988101e71b4"},{"source_id":"local_sup_species_elemental_lifeforms_02","provider":"local_dialogue","role":"local_dialogue_verification","title":"若忘记家在何处","url":"local://YuanShenResources/CHS/Quest/Quest_13019.json#unit=1301906","language":"zh-CN","revision_id":"OSCBWin6.7.54","source_text_sha256":"360ce4ec54f36b36fd76e0eef902cd39be6346865cf8ae1768227305fb437022"},{"source_id":"local_sup_species_elemental_lifeforms_03","provider":"local_dialogue","role":"local_dialogue_verification","title":"若忘记家在何处","url":"local://YuanShenResources/CHS/Quest/Quest_13019.json#unit=1301912","language":"zh-CN","revision_id":"OSCBWin6.7.54","source_text_sha256":"8f3ab336a4338d4cb525f77e5e06c7e8afd32a004632bebc3f55f78d5d6c0e32"},{"source_id":"local_sup_species_elemental_lifeforms_04","provider":"local_dialogue","role":"local_dialogue_verification","title":"若忘记家在何处","url":"local://YuanShenResources/CHS/Quest/Quest_13019.json#unit=1301923","language":"zh-CN","revision_id":"OSCBWin6.7.54","source_text_sha256":"46e575f227a02c3fb4390ee2426eef9432c4ca76ffa12edb3faed97a4743d16d"}],"evidence_bundle_sha256":"cd4bebfecfb5498ffbba57ffa665035c3a5e312ccec4510413704ac525351be2","review":{"cross_language_conflicts":[],"uncertain_claims":["主要来源关于元素生命“仅由一种元素构成”的定义与同页多元素分类条目存在内部不一致。","特殊个体关于其族群古老程度、适应力及变形机制的陈述缺少本证据包内的独立佐证，只能保留为自述。"],"missing_evidence":["现有证据不足以确定元素生命这一分类在提瓦特普通社会中的普遍认知程度及知识传播途径。"],"needs_human_review":true}}